    "specialMechanics": "",
    "description": "The hero with Water Control Powers can use available liquid water for specific effects. The water can be used as a missile weapon, inflicting Power rank damage at 1 area range. The water can also be used as a shield, having no effect on physical weapons, but reducing energy, force, and fire attacks by the rank number of the Power. The hero with Water Control may develop Power stunts. including:\n• Creation of watery \"servants\" of Power rank Health and Abilities.\n• Using water to speed ships and water vehicles, at Power rank Speed.\n• Creating bubbles of air to allow others to survive underwater.\n• Limited Weather Control: create fog of Power rank Intensity.\n• Limited Weather Control: create storms of Power rank Intensity.\n• Melting solid ice as if Water Control Power was Fire Generation of Power rank intensity",
